  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The applicant has failed to submit a site-specific Flood Risk Assessment and drainage strategy. In the absence of this information, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the proposed development would be safe for its lifetime, without increasing flood risk elsewhere, or that appropriate sustainable drainage measures can be secured. The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies CN3 and CN4 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021 - 2041).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
